Tool response:
Tool: deactivate_station
Description: Update the status of a specified station to 'Inactive' and log the deactivation reason and audit note in the history table. The user performing this action must be authenticated.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "station_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Internal ID of the station to deactivate",
          "title": "Station Id"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Reason"
        },
        "audit_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Audit Note"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "station_id"
      ]
    }
